I hold the derived copies of the Alexandrie experiments, one class-side method each,
and nothing else.

Every method of mine is generated by VGAlexandrieCase >> #portedSource from the matching method of
AlexandrieCairoExperiment: the Alexandrie class names that have a counterpart of ours are
substituted, the <sampleInstance> pragma is dropped, and no other character changes. Do not edit
them by hand — send #regenerate and commit what it writes.
"
